commit 9fad6c6626304b60f8ae20d885f69b3ffd5c2ccd

C03: the finals of a real test send may name the destination and the person's own words (MAIL1853 measured three vetoes on truthful replies): the send receipt's forced destination, requested recipient and text are observed literals, so an address is no longer read as an internal code; a bracket the person wrote themselves is not a template hole; and the retry hint quotes both destinations so the model copies them instead of paraphrasing («el canal de prueba de Emmanuel»)

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>


